{"candidateAnswer":"Zelda BOTW, Animal Crossing, Overcooked 2","evidence":"[D19:8 | 12:52 am on 19 August, 2023] Jolene: I have a few game recommendations. Zelda BOTW for Switch is an awesome open-world game. Animal Crossing: New Horizons is really calming and cute. As for my favorite game, it's hard to choose just one!\n[D19:10 | 12:52 am on 19 August, 2023] Jolene: Oh, I forgot to mention Overcooked 2 - this is a good co-op game if you're into hilarious and chaotic cooking. My partner and I often play for bets! I once won three large pizzas!","itemId":"urn:uuid:5ca1e97e-6cf2-574d-bc6d-90b597f243b4","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d819fd97f3f0122e3c07b91237f3082c1584bc4e6ce6cc21dfcc69778f1660cf","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What games does Jolene recommend for Deborah?","referenceAnswer":"Zelda BOTW for Switch , Animal Crossing: New Horizons, Overcooked 2","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d819fd97f3f0122e3c07b91237f3082c1584bc4e6ce6cc21dfcc69778f1660cf"}}]}